\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel \highlight\uc2  Shekel Unchanged Vs Dollar, Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Israel Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Januar 1997\par 16:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading Thursday to weaken the shekel and keep it from strengthening beyond its trading band, foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel closed unchanged versus the dollar at 3.3120 shekels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket against which the shekel is adjusted was valued at 3.6265 shekels, a rise of 0.027% compared with Wednesday's close of 3.6263 shekels. \par \par \uc2  The dollar dominates the basket of major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for both the dollar and the basket each session. \par \par \uc2  The shekel has been bloated by a discount rate that is high relative to those for other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  - 14.7% after five recent cuts - leading customers to borrow in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  or raise capital abroad and convert the money to shekels. \par \par \uc2  This month the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost daily to keep the shekel from strengthening beyond its strongest point within the trading band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued throughout the day Thursday, Michal Rotlevy, a foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at United Mizrahi Bank, said. \par \par \uc2  People converted a lot of dollars and continued to take out foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  loans, she said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar ranged from 3.3060 shekels to 3.3160 shekels, a dealer at Bank Hapoalim said. There were large-scale conversions and trading volume was moderate, he said. \par \par \uc2  -Amy Teibel \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1533GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1u00oa2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
