\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel At Record Low Versus Dollar \b0\par\par\uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Januar 1997\par 16:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)-- The dollar closed Tuesday at its highest level ever against the shekel after strengthening against major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said Sandrine Finkelstein, a foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at United Mizrahi Bank. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel fixed the dollar at 3.3190 shekels, a rise of 0.393% against Monday's close of 3.3060 shekels. A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokeswoman said the dollar has not been stronger against the shekel since the New Israel Shekel was introduced on Sept. 4, 1985 as part of an economic stabilization plan. \par \par \uc2  There were 'heavy sales of dollars because people see the dollar is high,' one trader said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar ranged from 3.3140 shekels to 3.3190 shekels throughout the day, traders said, noting that volume was high. \par \par \uc2  The dollar dominates a basket of major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the shekel is adjusted, and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for both the dollar and the basket each session. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading this month to keep the shekel from strengthening beyond its strongest point within the trading band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again Tuesday, and foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers described the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as heavy. A dealer at the First International Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  noted that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  began \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in early afternoon - 'and that's not usual,' he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  closer to the end of the trading session, traders said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 28-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1526GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1s00mvy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
