\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel \highlight\uc2  Shekel Weakens Slightly Vs Dlr; Nat Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 280 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Januar 1997\par 17:37\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The shekel closed down slightly against the dollar Monday as the Bank of Israel sold shekels just ahead of the fixing. \par \par \uc2  During the day, the private sector sold dollars heavily for shekels to take advantage of high interest rates. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  shortly before the fixing to weaken the shekel and bring it back within the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel closed down 0.182% against the dollar Monday at 3.3060, compared to 3.30 to the dollar Friday. \par \par \uc2  The shekel closed down 0.019% against a basket of five major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which it is adjusted. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket traded at 3.6247 shekels versus 3.6240 shekels Friday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket is dominated by the dollar, and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for both the dollar and the basket each session. \par \par \uc2  During most of the day the shekel strengthened beyond its strongest point within the trading band, said trader Guy Leshem of Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  Another trader, speaking on condition of anonymity, estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  worth $50 million just a few minutes before the fixing. \par \par \uc2  If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have purchased dollars to keep the shekel within the band all day, the sums spent would have been much larger, he added. \par \par \uc2  After the fixing, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it will cut its discount rate by half a percentage point to 14.2% next month. The move is expected to ease pressure on the shekel to appreciate in trading Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -Avi Temkin \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 27-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1637GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1r00gz2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
