\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Reaches Eight-Month Low Against Dollar \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Januar 1997\par 17:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)-- The shekel reached an eight-month low against the dollar at the Bank of Israel fixing Thursday, pulled down by the dollar's strengthening against major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At the same time, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  was forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again to weaken the shekel against a basket of five major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bring it back within the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band. \par \par \uc2  Trading volume was moderate to heavy, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was valued at 3.3030 shekels, a rise of 0.182% against Wednesday's fixing of 3.2970 shekels. Thursday marked the first time the fixing has topped 3.30 shekels since May 30, the day after Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu's election. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket rose 0.016% to 3.6224 shekels from 3.6218 shekels after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought as much as $100 million or more in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  The basket is dominated by the dollar, and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for both the dollar and the basket each session. \par \par \uc2  The strengthening of the dollar prompted large-scale conversions, said Ilan Engel of Koor Capital Markets. \par \par \uc2  'At more than 3.30 (shekels to the dollar), people were very happy to sell dollars,' Engel said. \par \par \uc2  'As long as the dollar-mark exchange rate stays at its present level, the dollar-shekel rate can only go up, not down,' said Shmulik Reuveni, head of local market derivatives at Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  And as long as the dollar goes up, 'we'll see the (Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  continue,' Engel said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 23-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1613GMT \par \par \uc2  1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1n00j2b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
