\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Israel Intervenes \highlight\uc2  to Weaken Shekel \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Januar 1997\par 16:19\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading on Wednesday to weaken the shekel, which had strengthened to a point outside the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $100 million in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The shekel closed down 0.022% in moderate trading against the basket of major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which it is adjusted. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket traded at 3.6218 shekels at the fixing, compared with 3.6210 shekels on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket is dominated by the dollar, and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for both the dollar and the basket each session. \par \par \uc2  The shekel weakened 0.396% against the dollar, and at the Bank of Israel fixing traded at 3.2970 to the dollar, as opposed to 3.2840 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Michal Rotlevy, a dealer at United Mizrahi Bank, said the dollar went up in Jerusalem after going up strong against major European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the Japanese yen. \par \par \uc2  The strengthening of the dollar led to increased conversions of dollars into shekels, said a dealer at First International Bank of Israel. \par \par \uc2  The dollar traded in a narrow band of 3.29 shekels to 3.30 shekels, she said. \par \par \uc2  Both Rotley and the dealer at First International estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $100 million in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost daily for more than a week to protect its trading band. \par \par \uc2  Both dealers called Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  a continuation of a trend that began last week. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1519GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1m00k37\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
