\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of Israel/ \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: Aims To Keep Shekel Within Band \b0\par\par\uc2 312 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Januar 1997\par 17:06\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Until its discount rate falls to about 13% from the current 14.7%, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be forced to keep \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Meitav's Hoffman said. However, Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Jacob Frenkel has made it clear that the discount rate - kept high to tame inflation - will remain steep until the government proves it's going to cut the budget deficit. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel will announce February's discount-rate setting Monday. If any cut takes place, expectations are that it will be no higher than 0.50 percentage point. \par \par \uc2  Another factor in the demand for shekels is the rally put on by the dollar so far in 1997, said Ilan Viskin, trading-room manager at Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  With the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rising to 3.2840 shekels at Tuesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixing from 3.2510 shekels at the end of December, players figure it's time to cash in their dollars for shekels, Viskin said. \par \par \uc2  The exchange rate has been relatively high for several months, and a significant devaluation of the shekel that would cause a flight to foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't seem to be in the offing so long as the discount rate stays high. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket against which the shekel trades is composed about 60% of the dollar, about 20% of the Deutsche mark, about 9% of sterling and about 6% each of the yen and the French franc. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  permits the shekel to fluctuate by up to 7% on either side of a gradually depreciating midpoint, and it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from trading above its band. \par \par \uc2  Traders say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been aimed at bringing the shekel back within its trading band, not weakening the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  significantly. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 21-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1606GMT \par \par \uc2  1142 1802 1805 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dt1l002y1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
