\par\par \b \uc2  Israel/Shekel -2: No Significant Cut Seen For Discount Rate \b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Januar 1997\par 17:14\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Israel's discount rate is so high relative to those for other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  that customers are borrowing in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and converting them to shekels. \par \par \uc2  Last week, the shekel strengthened to a point outside the band, and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading for the first time in about four months to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has since \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in trading almost every day for a week. \par \par \uc2  On Monday, the bank bought an estimated $100 million to $150 million in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , bringing its total purchases in the past week to about $500 million, one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Michal Rotlevy, a dealer at United Mizrahi Bank, said that the number of conversions from foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to shekels prompted the Bank of Israel to buy a lot of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bring the shekel back within its trading band. \par \par \uc2  'People are still converting foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to shekels; they're not expecting the discount rate to drop significantly in the near future,' explained Guy Levy, a senior foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Bank Leumi. \par \par \uc2  Optimists are expecting a cut of one-fourth to one-half of a percentage point, if the discount rate is cut at all, Levy said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel will announce the February discount rate Jan. 27. \par \par \uc2  -Amy Teibel \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1614GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1k00dwz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
