change rate is allowed to fluctuate 7% in each direction from a midpoint. The shekel has been pushing the strongest point of its trading band for several weeks due to a 14.7% discount rate that has attracted investors to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1611GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1k00dws\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
