\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Stable in Quiet Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Januar 1997\par 05:19\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (Dow Jones)--The shekel closed slightly up against the dollar and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket in quiet trading on Thursday. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and the shekel remained at its strongest point within the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band, said Aviv Raiz from Eurotrust Ltd. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel fixing was 3.2630 shekels to the dollar, an appreciation of 0.153% compared to Wednesday's fixing of 3.2680 shekels. \par \par \uc2  The Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose 0.0002% against the five-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket against which it is adjusted, rising to 3.6186 shekels from 3.6185 shekels on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The basket is dominated by the dollar and also includes the German mark, the British pound, the Japanese yen and the French franc. \par \par \uc2  "It was a relatively dull market today, there were small buying and selling orders. The shekel fixing against the dollar reflected developments in the international markets," said Shimon Vaacnin a trader with United Mizrahi Bank. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket exchange rate is allowed to fluctuate 7% in each direction from a midpoint. The shekel has been pushing the strongest point of its trading band for several weeks, in part because of 14.7% discount rate that has attracted investors to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The present situation can remain unchanged for a while, but eventually there will have to be a movement. It is not natural for the shekel to remain so close to the upper limit of the band for a long period of time," Raiz said. \par \par \uc2  -Avi Temkin \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 17-01-97 \par \par \uc2  0419GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1802 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dt1h002ir\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
