\par\par \b \uc2  Shekel fixed sharply lower against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Jan 15 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed sharply lower against the dollar on Wednesday after the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose to a 30-month high against the mark in world markets, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market on a relatively big scale to prevent the basket from falling by more than seven percent below the diagonal rate," said a dealer at Israel Discount Bank. \par \par \uc2  "The shekel declined as the dollar rose sharply against the mark. The rise of the dollar abroad pushed the basket downwards," he said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel is allowed to fluctuate in a trading band of seven percent above or below a sloping mid-point designed to devalue the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a rate of six percent a year against the basket of key \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in three of the last five trading sessions in a bid to keep the basket rate within the band. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.2680 shekels against 3.2590 shekels on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6185 shekels against 3.6172 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7835 shekels per 100 yen versus 2.7993 on Tuesday and against the mark at 2.0451 shekels versus 2.0562 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.2680 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - 