\par\par \b \uc2  Shekel rises against dollar, basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Januar 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Jan 14 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed slightly higher against the dollar and the basket of key foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local market to support the basket, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Trading was very quiet today. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in local trading after the dollar declined overseas," said a dealer at Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars on a relatively high scale but it failed to raise the basket above seven percent below the diagonal rate," she said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel is allowed to fluctuate in a trading band of seven percent above or below a sloping mid-point designed to devalue the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a rate of six percent a year against the basket of key \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.2590 shekels against 3.2620 shekels on Monday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6172 shekels against 3.6192 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7993 shekels per 100 yen against 2.8032 on Monday and against the mark at 2.0562 shekels against 2.0542 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.2600 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt1e06ca4\par }\