\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Strengthens Against  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Basket \b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Januar 1997\par 16:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The shekel strengthened slightly against a basket of major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the Bank of Israel fixing on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The shekel briefly exceeded its strongest point within the trading band set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken it, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket was valued at 3.6145 shekels, a drop of 0.132% compared to Tuesday's close of 3.6193 shekels. \par \par \uc2  The dollar, which dominates the basket, rose 0.92% at the fixing to 3.2470 shekels from Tuesday's close of 3.2440 shekels. \par \par \uc2  'Most of the day the dollar strengthened against the mark, and it strengthened against the shekel at the same time,' said a foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at the First International Bank of Israel. Volume was moderate, he said. \par \par \uc2  Tal Zindorf, an economist at Bank Hapoalim, said the trading session was 'nothing special,' adding that she doesn't expect any sharp changes because Bank of Israel Governor Jacob Frenkel has made it clear that he won't cut the discount rate until he sees the budget deficit shrink.' \par \par \uc2  The 14.7% discount rate is so high relative to those for other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  that customers are still borrowing in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and converting them to shekels. \par \par \uc2  Maybe the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will be more interesting toward the end of the month, when Frenkel announces the February discount rate, she said. \par \par \uc2  Zindorf also suggested that the capital market's attention may have been diverted to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange, which has been enjoying sharp rises on large volumes. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 08-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1511GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt18002ci\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
