\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Israel interventions \highlight\uc2  not inflationary. \b0\par\par\uc2 204 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 September 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Sept 24 (Reuter) - Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Jacob Frenkel said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets were not inflationary as other monetary measures were being taken. \par \par \uc2  "All injections are being sterilised. There is no single shekel in the market beyond what we want," Frenkel told Reuters on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  frequently in the past month to prevent the shekel from strengthening beyond its permitted trading band. \par \par \uc2  Israeli banks estimate the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has injected more than a billion shekels through its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Daily (monetary) auctions and other monetary instruments are being used to ensure that the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are not allowed to alter the base of monetary expansion beyond what we in the bank think is warranted," Frenkel said. \par \par \uc2  "To date (the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) are fully sterilised." \par \par \uc2  On September 2 the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  suspended its daily auctions for loans to commercial banks in light of excess liquidity. The auctions were resumed on September 17. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel blamed pressures in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on the government's widening budget deficit and not on interest rates. \par \par \uc2  - Tova Cohen, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds9o02jrv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
