\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel weakens against dollar, basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 September 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Sept 9 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel weakened against the dollar and the basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  following several \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The basket was trading today at 7.1 percent below the slope and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times in the market by buying dollars to support the basket," said Gideon Sadeh at Bank Leumi. \par \par \uc2  "Despite the fact that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a relatively high scale the basket traded after the setting of the representative rate at 7.01 percent below the slope," he said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel can fluctuate in a trading band of 7.0 percent above or below a slope designed to devalue the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at six percent a year against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  representing Israel's main trading partners. \par \par \uc2  If the shekel-basket exchange rate reaches the lower trading band the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was 3.1530 against 3.1470 on Friday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, closed at 3.5442 shekels against 3.5430 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.8933 shekels per 100 yen against 2.8812 on Friday and against the mark at 2.1135 shekels per mark against 2.1205 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.1525 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds9903bcm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
