\par\par \b \uc2  Israel/News-2: Credit Rating in Danger of Being Lowered \b0\par\par\uc2 286 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 September 1996\par 10:31\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Both papers said Moody's sent the Bank of Israel a letter warning that Israel's credit rating would be lowered to A- or BBB+ from A because of the balance of payments deficit, the trade deficit, its own internal debt and an increase in the foreign debt. Globes said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  denied receiving such a letter. \par \par \uc2  A Standard & Poors delegation that visited Israel last month said a ratings drop was likely, Globes reported. Moody's "A" rating is equivalent to S&P's "A-." \par \par \uc2  -- The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading on Monday to protect its exchange rate policy. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading last week for the first time since February after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket exchange rate fell through its appointed floor. Banks cited by Globes said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday was "substantial" and on a larger scale than last week. \par \par \uc2  -- The Bank of Israel canceled its one-day loans to banks again on Monday in an attempt to absorb some of the excess liquidity created by government spending. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it will issue a special statement when it resumes the loans. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has warned that it can't continue lowering interest rates because of the large budget deficit. \par \par \uc2  -- The Bank of Israel needs a monetary council, headed by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor, to set monetary policy, the Jerusalem Post reported, citing a panel examining the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Under the current system, the Bank of Israel governor receives recommendations from an advisory committee. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 03-09-96 \par \par \uc2  0831GMT \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011013ds9300dpe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
