\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of Israel buys dlrs to support basket rate. [CORRECTED 17:11 GMT] \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 August 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Aug 29 (Reuter) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the trading of the shekel, buying dollars to prevent the shekel from trading beyond the band within which it is allowed to fluctuate, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Just before the representative rates were published (at 1215 GMT) the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bring the shekel-basket rate to seven percent below the slope," a dealer at United Mizrahi Bank said. \par \par \uc2  "After the rates were published and about 10 mintues before the end of trading (at 1400 GMT) the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought again," he said. \par \par \uc2  The amount of dollars purchased, though small, was slightly more than the few million bought on Wednesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, buying from us on a very low scale," a dealer at \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Discount Bank confirmed. \par \par \uc2  Despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the shekel-basket rate slipped to 3.5377 at the end of trading from the representative rate of 3.5384. The rate is now 7.01 (corrects from 7.1) percent below the slope, or just outside the trading band. \par \par \uc2  The shekel can fluctuate seven percent above or below a diagonal slope designed to devalue the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at six percent a year against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  representing Israel's main trading partners. \par \par \uc2  If the shekel-basket exchange rate reaches the lower band the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  supports the rate by buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not comment on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  - Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds8t03p1c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
