\par\par \b \uc2  Israel's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 / \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2:  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Basket Dips \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 August 1996\par 17:20\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV (Dow Jones) --The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading for the second straight day Wednesday, after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket exchange rate dipped below the lowest point the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it would allow. \par \par \uc2  The rate had hovered around the red line throughout the day, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  began buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the late afternoon. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was very light, as it was yesterday," said Sandrine Finkelstein, a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at United Mizrahi Bank. \par \par \uc2  To moderate cycles of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculation that were fueled by expectations of devaluation, Israel linked the shekel to a basket of five \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 1986. The dollar is weighted heaviest, accounting for about 60% of the basket. \par \par \uc2  The other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the basket are the German mark (weighted about 20%), the British pound (about 9%), the Japanese yen (about 6%) and the French franc, (about 6%). \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket exchange rate is allowed to fluctuate by 7% in each direction from the given midpoint rate. The midpoint rate will depreciate this year by 6% --  which is the difference between Israel's inflation rate and the rate of inflation in the countries whose \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are in the basket. \par \par \uc2  The basket had been inching toward the low point for weeks, as the shekel remained strong because of high shekel interest rates. Then on Tuesday, for the first time since the exchange rate policy was set in 1991, the basket dipped below the red line. \par \par \uc2  A few minutes before trading closed on Tuesday, the Bank of Israel bought small amounts of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost the basket back within the exchange rate range. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 08-28-96 \par \par \uc2  1120EDT \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011013ds8s00jki\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
