\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervenes \highlight\uc2  in shekel trading. \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 August 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Aug 28 (Reuter) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the trading of the shekel on Wednesday by buying small amounts of dollars, preventing the shekel from trading beyond the band within which it is allowed to fluctuate, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "It wasn't an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to change a trend, just an underlying of its committment to keep the shekel within the trading band," said Tal Vardi, chief dealer at Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  The shekel can fluctuate in a trading band of 7.0 percent above or below a slope designed to devalue the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at six percent a year against the basket of key \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  If the shekel-basket exchange rate reaches the lower trading band the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Vardi said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the shekel-basket rate came close to seven percent below the slope in inter-bank trading. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at United Mizrahi Bank also confirmed there had been a small \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "After the representative rates were published the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought a small amount of dollars and brought the (shekel-basket exchange) rate to 6.95 percent below the slope," he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buys foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  through some commercial banks. Dealers of the other banks said there had not been any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  through them. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not confirm \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  of this sort. \par \par \uc2  -Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds8s03mv9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
