\par\par \b \uc2  Israel's  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Basket Exchange Rate Falls Below Band \b0\par\par\uc2 308 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 August 1996\par 18:01\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV (Dow Jones)-- Israel's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket exchange rate fell on Tuesday slightly below the lowest point on the sloping band that the Bank of Israel has sworn to maintain. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Jacob Frenkel has said repeatedly that he will not let the exchange rate deviate outside the band. When the exchange rate fell 0.3% below the low point on Tuesday, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bought a small amount of dollars, said Hagit Shalvi, a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at Bank Leumi. \par \par \uc2  She wouldn't say how much the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought. The Bank of Israel's spokesman's office would not release details. \par \par \uc2  Trading closed with the dollar fetching 3.1375 shekels, down 0.1% over Monday's closing rate of 3.1410. The basket has been inching toward the low point for weeks as the shekel remained strong against the basket because of high shekel interest rates. \par \par \uc2  On Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  lowered interest rates by half a percentage point, but they will still remain a high 15.8% through September. \par \par \uc2  To moderate cycles of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculation that were fueled by expectations of devaluation, Israel linked the shekel to a basket of five \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 1986. The dollar is weighted heaviest, accounting for about 60% of the basket. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket exchange rate is allowed to fluctuate by 7% in each direction from the given midpoint rate. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel didn't say whether it would change the exchange rate policy or continue to buy foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the basket are the German mark (weighted about 20%), the British pound (about 9%), the Japanese yen (about 6%) and the French franc, about 6%, Shalvi said. \par \par \uc2  -Amy Teibel \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 08-27-96 \par \par \uc2  1201EDT \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011013ds8r00j3j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
