\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel rises against dollar, basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 August 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Aug 27 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel rose against the dollar and the basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in thin trading getting closer to the lower range of the band, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel can fluctuate in a trading band of 7.0 percent above or below a slope designed to devalue the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at six percent a year against the basket of key \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  If the shekel-basket exchange rate reaches the lower trading band the market believes the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Trading was very quiet today and the volume was low. Despite this, the shekel continued to rise and the basket was traded today at only 6.98 percent below the slope," said a dealer at Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  "The shekel is very close to the lower edge of the band and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  will soon have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," she said. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was 3.1370 against 3.1410 on Monday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, closed at 3.5385 shekels against 3.5402 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.9104 shekels per 100 yen against 2.9110 on Monday and against the mark at 2.1266 shekels per mark against 2.1244 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.1390 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2