\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of  \highlight22\uc2 Israel Intervenes \highlight\uc2  To Drive Shekel Down Against Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 207 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juli 1995\par 22:21\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV (DJ-EMR)--For the second day in a row Wednesday the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, buying U.S. dollars for Israeli shekels and driving the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to 2.98 shekels to the dollar from 2.95 shekels at Tuesday's close, according to market sources. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday had pushed the shekel down 0.30% against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  But some market players attempted to push the shekel higher again Wednesday and the Bank of Israel was prompted to step in. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was said to have bought tens of millions of dollars during several \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  According to some analysts, the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have been enough to scare the market away from boosting the shekel and into actually depreciating the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At the same time the basket of European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Japanese yen, and the dollar rose by 1% against the shekel. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel in recent weeks has come under pressure to devalue the shekel in order to boost exports. But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has resisted, citing an inevitable rise in inflation. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 07-26-95 \par \par \uc2  1621EDT \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \p