\par\par \b \uc2  Shekel drops on dollar, basket unit. \b0\par\par\uc2 203 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Mai 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, May 11 (Reuter) - The shekel weakened against the dollar and the basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to contain further appreciation of the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel closed the daily tender at 3.0030 shekels per dollar against 2.9750 on Wednesday. The basket unit, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, closed at 3.4845 shekels per basket unit against 3.4833 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again today, buying dollars, as it wants to see the dollar higher," said dealer Guy Levy. \par \par \uc2  The shekel has been very strong in recent months, buoyed by high domestic interest rates. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has ruled out any sort of devaluation, despite calls to do so from exporters, but has consistently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to prevent any further appreciation of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 3.5350 shekels per 100 yen against 3.5714 on Wednesday, and against the mark at 2.1276 shekels per mark from 2.1500 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.0025 shekels. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr5b07wod\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
